# Ralph Orchestrator implementation issues

Approved 15-slice implementation backlog derived from [PRD.md](../../PRD.md). All issues are **AFK**: the design is approved and no additional design interview is required before implementing a ready issue. Product approval gates are behavior to implement, not a reason to mark these tickets HITL.

## Repository grounding

At authoring, only PRD.md exists outside Git metadata. There is no implementation, package manifest, test suite, initial commit, or project instruction/ADR file. All source paths and exported symbols named by these tickets are **proposed contracts**. PRD line references are real; line numbers for nonexistent source are deliberately omitted.

